mons and ancient celestials in order to find his own path towards immortality.</p>","updated":1795432539,"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/shows/49302"},"previousepisode":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/3828310","name":"Episode 202"},"nextepisode":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/3828311","name":"Episode 203"}}}}},{"id":3824890,"url":"https://www.tvmaze.com/episodes/3824890/silent-echoes-1x11-episode-11","name":"Episode 11","season":1,"number":11,"type":"regular","airdate":"2026-11-28","airtime":"12:00","airstamp":"2026-11-28T04:00:00+00:00","runtime":null,"rating":{"average":null},"image":null,"summary":null,"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/3824890"},"show":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/shows/75892","name":"Silent Echoes"}},"_embedded":{"show":{"id":75892,"url":"https://www.tvmaze.com/shows/75892/silent-echoes","name":"Silent Echoes","type":"Scripted","language":"Chinese","genres":["Drama","Crime"],"status":"Running","runtime":null,"averageRuntime":42,"premiered":"2026-11-20","ended":null,"officialSite":"https://v.youku.com/v_nextstage/id_cecdae482cad4e049926.html","schedule":{"time":"12:00","days":["Monday","Tuesday","Wednesday","Thursday","Friday","Saturday","Sunday"]},"rating":{"average":null},"weight":50,"network":null,"webChannel":{"id":118,"name":"Youku","country":{"name":"China","code":"CN","timezone":"Asia/Shanghai"},"officialSite":null},"dvdCountry":null,"externals":{"tvrage":null,"thetvdb":null,"imdb":null},"image":{"medium":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_portrait/519/1298994.jpg","original":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/519/1298994.jpg"},"summary":"<p>In 2011, a murder case occurs at Jiugu Lake in Xiping City. Detective Ma Xuesong and rookie female officer Meng Wen begin investigating and discover the case is linked to the disappearance of Luo Xue, involving multiple parties including the Deli Group. As more murders surface, a criminal network involving drugs, money laundering, and abuse gradually comes to light. Throughout the investigation, the two draw closer to the truth while each undergoes their own growth and trials.</p>","updated":1795377477,"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/shows/75892"},"previousepisode":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/3824890","name":"Episode 11"},"nextepisode":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/3824891","name":"Episode 12"}}}}},{"id":3815308,"url":"https://www.tvmaze.com/episodes/3815308/blossom-in-darkness-1x24-episode-24","name":"Episode 24","season":1,"number":24,"type":"regular","airdate":"2026-11-28","airtime":"12:00","airstamp":"2026-11-28T04:00:00+00:00","runtime":null,"rating":{"average":null},"image":null,"summary":null,"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/3815308"},"show":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/shows/78584","name":"Blossom in Darkness"}},"_embedded":{"show":{"id":78584,"url":"https://www.tvmaze.com/shows/78584/blossom-in-darkness","name":"Blossom in Darkness","type":"Scripted","language":"Chinese","genres":["Drama","Romance"],"status":"Running","runtime":null,"averageRuntime":47,"premiered":"2026-11-15","ended":null,"officialSite":"https://v.youku.com/v_nextstage/id_adcf514e1f7b412a91e3.html","schedule":{"time":"12:00","days":["Monday","Tuesday","Wednesday","Thursday","Friday","Saturday","Sunday"]},"rating":{"average":null},"weight":65,"network":null,"webChannel":{"id":118,"name":"Youku","country":{"name":"China","code":"CN","timezone":"Asia/Shanghai"},"officialSite":null},"dvdCountry":null,"externals":{"tvrage":null,"thetvdb":null,"imdb":null},"image":{"medium":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_portrait/651/1629269.jpg","original":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/651/1629269.jpg"},"summary":"<p>The play is adapted based on Guoguo's novel of the same name. Big Demon Qi Fengyin (acted by Li Hongyi), born out of evil thoughts, is locked in the Panic Mountain Barrier due to his killing of the mortals and immortals a thousand years ago. The small Medicine Spirit Yamao (acted by Sun Zhenni), transformed from the herb Huanyangcao, is chased by all sorts of people due to its magic physique and happens to break in the barrier, leading Qi Fengyin's failure to have a human body and his evil thoughts fly. Since then, the two have had a deep bond and have experienced all kinds of stories together.</p>","updated":1795284963,"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/shows/78584"},"previousepisode":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/3815308","name":"Episode 24"},"nextepisode":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/3815309","name":"Episode 25"}}}}},{"id":3833946,"url":"https://www.tvmaze.com/episodes/3833946/the-story-untold-1x07-episode-7","name":"Episode 7","season":1,"number":7,"type":"regular","airdate":"2026-11-28","airtime":"12:00","airstamp":"2026-11-28T04:00:00+00:00","runtime":45,"rating":{"average":null},"image":null,"summary":null,"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/3833946"},"show":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/shows/87067","name":"The Story Untold"}},"_embedded":{"show":{"id":87067,"url":"https://www.tvmaze.com/shows/87067/the-story-untold","name":"The Story Untold","type":"Scripted","language":"Chinese","genres":["Drama","Romance"],"status":"Running","runtime":null,"averageRuntime":45,"premiered":"2026-11-26","ended":null,"officialSite":"https://v.youku.com/v_show/id_XNjQ5MjA3MjI5Ng==.html","schedule":{"time":"12:00","days":[]},"rating":{"average":null},"weight":56,"network":null,"webChannel":{"id":118,"name":"Youku","country":{"name":"China","code":"CN","timezone":"Asia/Shanghai"},"officialSite":null},"dvdCountry":null,"externals":{"tvrage":null,"thetvdb":null,"imdb":null},"image":{"medium":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_portrait/625/1562681.jpg","original":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/625/1562681.jpg"},"summary":"<p>Adapted from Twentine's novel The Story Untold, the drama follows Yang Zhao, an art restorer haunted by childhood trauma. She has long believed that her emotional wounds will never heal, until she meets Chen Mingsheng, a narcotics officer working undercover in Bai Ji's drug trafficking organization. Their encounter profoundly affects them both, but when his mission goes wrong, Chen Mingsheng is forced to disappear from Yang Zhao's life. Their abruptly interrupted relationship leaves an indelible mark on her heart. Three years later, Yang Zhao unexpectedly reunites with Chen Mingsheng in another city. Having lost a leg, he now lives an unassuming life as a taxi driver. Determined never to let him go again, Yang Zhao finally opens up to him, revealing her true self and allowing him into her world. However, during a trip, Chen Mingsheng's identity is exposed, forcing him to return to the front lines of the fight against drug trafficking. The two promise never to be separated again once his mission is complete. Yet when Yang Zhao finally receives news of Chen Mingsheng, she rushes to the hospital, only to find him fighting for his life. As she watches helplessly, she has no idea what fate has in store for them...</p>","updated":1795716952,"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/shows/87067"},"previousepisode":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/3833947","name":"Episode 8"},"nextepisode":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/3833948","name":"Episode 9"}}}}},{"id":3833947,"url":"https://www.tvmaze.com/episodes/3833947/the-story-untold-1x08-episode-8","name":"Episode 8","season":1,"number":8,"type":"regular","airdate":"2026-11-28","airtime":"12:00","airstamp":"2026-11-28T04:00:00+00:00","runtime":45,"rating":{"average":null},"image":null,"summary":null,"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/3833947"},"show":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/shows/87067","name":"The Story Untold"}},"_embedded":{"show":{"id":87067,"url":"https://www.tvmaze.com/shows/87067/the-story-untold","name":"The Story Untold","type":"Scripted","language":"Chinese","genres":["Drama","Romance"],"status":"Running","runtime":null,"averageRuntime":45,"premiered":"2026-11-26","ended":null,"officialSite":"https://v.youku.com/v_show/id_XNjQ5MjA3MjI5Ng==.html","schedule":{"time":"12:00","days":[]},"rating":{"average":null},"weight":56,"network":null,"webChannel":{"id":118,"name":"Youku","country":{"name":"China","code":"CN","timezone":"Asia/Shanghai"},"officialSite":null},"dvdCountry":null,"externals":{"tvrage":null,"thetvdb":null,"imdb":null},"image":{"medium":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_portrait/625/1562681.jpg","original":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/625/1562681.jpg"},"summary":"<p>Adapted from Twentine's novel The Story Untold, the drama follows Yang Zhao, an art restorer haunted by childhood trauma. She has long believed that her emotional wounds will never heal, until she meets Chen Mingsheng, a narcotics officer working undercover in Bai Ji's drug trafficking organization. Their encounter profoundly affects them both, but when his mission goes wrong, Chen Mingsheng is forced to disappear from Yang Zhao's life. Their abruptly interrupted relationship leaves an indelible mark on her heart. Three years later, Yang Zhao unexpectedly reunites with Chen Mingsheng in another city. Having lost a leg, he now lives an unassuming life as a taxi driver. Determined never to let him go again, Yang Zhao finally opens up to him, revealing her true self and allowing him into her world. However, during a trip, Chen Mingsheng's identity is exposed, forcing him to return to the front lines of the fight against drug trafficking. The two promise never to be separated again once his mission is complete. Yet when Yang Zhao finally receives news of Chen Mingsheng, she rushes to the hospital, only to find him fighting for his life. As she watches helplessly, she has no idea what fate has in store for them...</p>","updated":17957169