er, her dreams of luxury quickly shatter: while Xie Yan was once a brilliant prodigy, he has been left disabled and disgraced by a tragic accident. Xie Yan has become bitter and self-destructive and resents Bao Zhu, who he feels has been forced upon him. The marriage gets off to a rough start, as Xie Yan and Bao Zhu are constantly fighting. But as they navigate the treacherous political schemes surrounding the canal transport industry and fend off ambitious relatives, their mutual animosity slowly transforms. Can they find a way to work together to save their crumbling family legacy and their marriage?</p>","updated":1795637960,"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/shows/91202"},"previousepisode":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/3822814","name":"Episode 19"},"nextepisode":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/3822815","name":"Episode 20"}}}}},{"id":3838694,"url":"https://www.tvmaze.com/episodes/3838694/rising-turbulence-1x07-episode-7","name":"Episode 7","season":1,"number":7,"type":"regular","airdate":"2026-11-28","airtime":"12:00","airstamp":"2026-11-28T04:00:00+00:00","runtime":35,"rating":{"average":null},"image":null,"summary":null,"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/3838694"},"show":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/shows/95117","name":"Rising Turbulence"}},"_embedded":{"show":{"id":95117,"url":"https://www.tvmaze.com/shows/95117/rising-turbulence","name":"Rising Turbulence","type":"Scripted","language":"Chinese","genres":["Drama","Mystery"],"status":"Running","runtime":null,"averageRuntime":35,"premiered":"2026-11-27","ended":null,"officialSite":"https://v.qq.com/x/cover/mzc002009mpc3y6.html","schedule":{"time":"12:00","days":["Monday","Tuesday","Wednesday","Thursday","Friday","Saturday","Sunday"]},"rating":{"average":null},"weight":58,"network":null,"webChannel":{"id":104,"name":"Tencent QQ","country":{"name":"China","code":"CN","timezone":"Asia/Shanghai"},"officialSite":"https://v.qq.com/"},"dvdCountry":null,"extern